OL,3,GNEWSA'No timescale' for beauty spot
OL,4,Aexpansion decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to expand the Surrey Hills
OL,7,FNational Landscape have been submitted
OL,8,Fto the government.
OL,10,FThe plans by Natural England would see
OL,11,Fan additional 50 square miles (129
OL,12,Fsquare km) of land added to the area of
OL,13,Foutstanding natural beauty, increasing
OL,14,Fthe current boundary by 30.5%.
OL,16,FThe Department for Environment Food and
OL,17,FRural Affairs (Defra) will now consider
OL,18,Fwhether to approve, amend or reject the
OL,19,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
