OL,3,GNEWSA'No timescale' for beauty spot
OL,4,Aexpansion decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FDefra said there was no timescale for
OL,7,Freaching its decision and that the
OL,8,Fareas being considered will "gain no
OL,9,Fnew status unless and until it is
OL,10,Fconfirmed".
